            "prose": "MINECRAFT_ONLINE_MODE defaults to true, and an online-mode server calls sessionserver.mojang.com itself to check that a connecting client really authenticated with Mojang/Microsoft before letting them in. This is the server's own outbound call, not the player's connection, which arrives on the api port below. Set MINECRAFT_ONLINE_MODE=false to run with no egress at all -- at the cost of accepting any username a client claims."
